  "Open a Hub dataset or register a local directory. Episodes synchronize camera playback and signal charts. Space toggles playback; arrow keys navigate episodes. Use Frames to compare first and last frames.": "打开 Hub 数据集或登记本地目录。「片段」同步播放相机视频与信号图表。空格切换播放，方向键切换片段。在「帧概览」比较首帧与末帧。",
  "Select Annotations to edit task augmentation, subtask, plan, memory, speech and VQA. Drag on a video for a bounding box or click for a keypoint. Save episode persists edits; Save dataset creates a new annotated export.": "在「标注」编辑任务扩写、子任务、计划、记忆、语音和视觉问答。拖动视频创建边界框，单击创建关键点。「保存当前片段」持久保存编辑，「导出标注数据集」生成新的数据副本。",
  "Statistics describes metadata and episode lengths. Filtering ranks low movement, sudden motion and unusual lengths. Action Insights computes autocorrelation, temporal alignment, speed variance and cross-episode variance. Doctor runs version-aware checks.": "「统计」展示元数据与片段长度。「筛选」定位低运动、突变和长度异常。「动作洞察」计算自相关、时序对齐、速度差异与跨片段方差。「数据诊断」执行与版本匹配的检查。",
